WEBVTT

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:33.130
My father is 86 years old, a nurse comes to the house every month.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:37.130
I checked his feet, feet, and foot pressure.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:39.130
Three years without going to the hospital.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.130
That's the result.

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:44.130
96% of our seniors are on Medicare Advantage.

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:47.130
The washing can pays us 41% less.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:51.130
In our pharmacies, we make sure patients stay adherent to their therapies

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.130
and we work with them.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.130
The health care paradox.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:01:02.770
How Puerto Rico navigates the system.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:05.770
New episodes weekly wherever you get your podcasts.

